error[E0277]: `DoubleWord<*mut u64, usize>` has no pure-read atomic load on this target
  --> tests/compile_fail/aarch64_without_lse2/load_on_a_two_word_value.rs:18:18
   |
18 |     let _ = head.load(Acquire);
   |                  ^^^^ this load would be a read-modify-write: it writes the line and faults on read-only pages
   |
   = help: the trait `Load` is not implemented for `DoubleWord<*mut u64, usize>`
   = note: a 128-bit load is one instruction with FEAT_LSE2 (aarch64: `-C target-cpu` of a CPU with LSE2) or AVX (x86_64: `-C target-cpu=x86-64-v3`)
   = note: to accept a load that writes the cache line, call `load_rmw`
   = help: the following other types implement trait `Load`:
             *mut T
             bool
             i16
             i32
             i64
             i8
             isize
             u16
           and $N others
note: required by a bound in `atomix::Atomic::<T>::load`
